            "text": "theorem sum_odd_conv (f g : ArithmeticFunction ℝ) (w : ℕ → ℂ) (M : ℕ)\n    (hw : ∀ n, M < n → w n = 0) :\n    ∑ n ∈ Icc 1 M, (if Odd n then ((f * g) n : ℂ) * w n else 0) =\n      ∑ a ∈ Icc 1 M, if Odd a then ∑ b ∈ Icc 1 M,\n        (if Odd b then (f a : ℂ) * g b * w (a * b) else 0) else 0 :=",
